Recommends: sudo,
Description: Postfix filter to encrypt outgoing email with OpenPGP
 Zeyple encrypts outgoing email bodies and attachments using recipients'
 public keys, then reinjects the messages into Postfix. It is intended for
 server reports and alerts that contain sensitive information.
 .
 The package doesn't change the Postfix configuration: plug Zeyple into
 Postfix once the recipients' keys are imported, as zeyple(8) explains.
